        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Anonymous;Code",
        "extract": "Anonymous;Code is a 2022 visual novel video game developed by Mages and Chiyomaru Studio, and is the sixth mainline entry in the Science Adventure series. Along with being a visual novel, it also has a fully working implementation of Conway's Game of Life built in that can be accessed via the in-game menu. Following a series of delays, the game was released for PlayStation 4 and Nintendo Switch on July 28, 2022 in Japan. A western English release, published by Spike Chunsoft, was announced in July 2022 with a Windows port, and released on September 8, 2023.\n\n",
