        "pageid": 74485077,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Arcadian Atlas",
        "extract": "Arcadian Atlas is a tactical role-playing video game developed by Twin Otter Studios and published in 2023 by Serenity Forge. The game features 2D pixel art graphics inspired by games of the '90s like Chrono Trigger, Breath of Fire, and Suikoden and gameplay reminiscent of titles such as Tactics Ogre and Final Fantasy Tactics.",
